// the Studio is on) | 'start' | 'colors' | 'style' | 'music' | 'tools' | 'save' | 'pro'. vis: a picture of its own
// instead of the glyph ('ges' the Studio's gestures, 'wheel' the twelve notes in the palette's colours, 'pal5').
